<title>FINLAND: JAMES CAPEL SAYS UPGRADES METRA TO &quot;BUY&quot;.</title>
<headline>JAMES CAPEL SAYS UPGRADES METRA TO &quot;BUY&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Capel has raised its recommendation for Finnish engineering group Metra Oy Ab to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, a James Capel analyst told Reuters by telephone on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He gave no details.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 248</p>
